{"server":"tw","storyId":"act17side_level_act17side_st01","groupId":"act17side","stageId":"act17side_01","title":"古井","storyCode":"SN-ST-1","avgTag":"幕間","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act17side/level_act17side_st01.txt","sourceHash":"29ee1d230c53d9c0916175e6de53df6919ba916337080c8f5a69f221157161ef","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"narration","text":"“大地”。\n這個詞語因狹隘而普及。\n是否在某個遠古的時期，我們曾有一些宏偉的語言，用來形容天地間的一切，用來形容我們的生活所觸及到的全部？\n這個偉大的詞語囊括土地與天空，以及內陸諸國知之甚少的浩瀚海洋......只需唇齒開合，一個單詞，或許就能描述萬億年來生命的進程？\n這個詞存在於人類思想的哪個角落，凱爾希？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_i25"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"您不會不知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"穩重的老者","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我知道的並不少，可我仍要日復一日地詢問，所有人都擺脫不了未知，而未知會永遠地拷問人類。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......（古老的薩卡茲語）“世界”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"穩重的老者","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"唔，我以為你會說......（薩爾貢語）“世界”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"穩重的老者","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那是薩卡茲的語言嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"是的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"穩重的老者","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"稀奇，一個自詡為醫生的菲林，第一反應居然是使用魔族的語言。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"穩重的老者","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你的身份就像海上的雲朵，變幻無常。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"語言不會因此而改變性質。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"穩重的老者","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"語言......你看，凱爾希，看這裡。一口井。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"穩重的老者","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你知道如何在這裡獲取淡水嗎？你知道伊比利亞人如何利用這片蔚藍的基石搭建房屋嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"如果曾經的伊比利亞貴族並沒有被傲慢衝昏頭腦，那海洋勢必會讓伊比利亞成為一座堅不可摧的堡壘。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"這口井很深，這裡離海很近。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"穩重的老者","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"看，這口井還沒有乾涸，它裝著一個假的太陽。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我們該趕路了，閣下。"},{"type":"narration","text":"老者沒有回答。他默默從地上拾起了一枚石子。\n一枚再普通不過的石子，沒有把玩的價值，可老者彷彿在感受海風留下的觸感，他依舊看著井底。\n凱爾希沒有追問，她默默等待面前的老人給出回答。她能看見雲在運動，風很大。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"穩重的老者","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不著急，凱爾希，不著急。我們還有很多時間歇息......無論你做好了什麼佈置。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"穩重的老者","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"從這裡投下一顆石子，要多久能聽見水聲？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"五六秒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"穩重的老者","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"伊比利亞最樸實的人民也懂得如何利用海洋，這口井的深度蘊藏著智慧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"而如今，一名維多利亞的農夫或是哥倫比亞的工人，也許連海洋的全貌都不知曉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"穩重的老者","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"唔......凱爾希，這一路上，我總共問過你幾個問題？"},{"type":"narration","text":"老人將握著石子的手臂懸在半空，鬆手，那枚石子從他的手中滑落。\n二人都注視著這枚石子，儘管很快，缺乏陽光的視野就無法再捕捉石子的軌跡。\n兩秒，或者是三秒，寂靜籠罩著二人。風聲都在此刻停止。\n寂靜。凱爾希想著，多麼寂靜。"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_i25"},{"type":"narration","text":"“撲通”。\n細小的聲響穿過井壁，彷彿在提醒二人，那短暫的、僅有數秒的瞬間裡，這片大地如此靜謐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"一百二十三個，這是個具有魔力的數字。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"穩重的老者","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"一百二十三個問題，一百二十三年。如今的審判庭裡......沒有比我更年長的審判官了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"穩重的老者","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"他們大都戰死，極少壽終正寢，還有些許，在這場看不見盡頭的折磨中敗給了怯懦，他們的下場都不算好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"穩重的老者","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我親歷過伊比利亞的所有。我曾看過艦隊揚帆，聽過維多利亞使節顫抖的嗓音。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"穩重的老者","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"大靜謐摧毀了一切，就像大夢初醒。所有伊比利亞人都還沉浸在對災難的痛恨與美夢破滅的茫然之中。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"黎博利並非長壽的種族，就算是黎博利的神民，那些健康的長壽者，也無法背負伊比利亞如今遭受的災厄。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"您的壽命是一個奇跡。審判庭創造的奇跡，也賦予了您前所未有的使命感。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"在那個思想與榮耀開始墜落的時代，您與那些最初的審判庭成員被尊稱為“聖徒”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"穩重的老者","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"“聖徒”，這個曾用來引領世人的稱號就像一把薪柴......如今徒留灰燼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"穩重的老者","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"一百二十三輪春夏秋冬，彷彿只有寒冬給我留下了痕跡。我見過很多真相，卻唯獨記不住春天的樣子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"穩重的老者","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......凱爾希。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"narration","text":"老人的眼神變了。\n信念是一種語言，禱告鋪成道路。伊比利亞這個國家，或是超越了國家的個體，此刻正輕撫自己的下巴，計算風的速度。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"穩重的老者","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我活到今天，度過了一百二十三年歲月。我問了你一百二十三個問題，與我曾經的體悟一一對應。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"穩重的老者","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"可你仍回答了我的每一個問題。你知道我知道的所有事情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"穩重的老者","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"人類在前進。秘密將永遠不斷湧現，可學識越不過名為“已知”的高牆。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"穩重的老者","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"而我們所對抗的，卻在那堵高牆的另一頭，那是一片昏暗的黑森林。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"穩重的老者","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"而你呢，凱爾希，你屬於高牆這頭......還是在森林的彼端？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"取決於您。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"穩重的老者","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哼，呵呵......你甚至知道那邊的樹上有多少樹葉，可怕的女人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"穩重的老者","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"伊比利亞的聖徒仍是窮盡人力所能抵達的頂峰，這毫無疑問。而你超出了這個範疇，所以你絕非常人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"穩重的老者","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"也許你利用了某種特別的法術延長了壽命，也許你傳承著某些古老的身份，又也許，你有一個曾立下宏願的靈魂。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"穩重的老者","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哪怕信仰不過是一場思想組成的騙局，我們也曾堅信希望。而可悲的是，直到衰老將我們一一打敗，我們仍然找不出解決問題的辦法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"穩重的老者","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那些依靠自身的源石技藝或是別的手段戰勝衰老的長生者，他們只會更加恐懼，恐懼遭受敵人無盡折磨的漫長歲月。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"阿戈爾何時也被伊比利亞視作未知的恐懼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"穩重的老者","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"一個赤手空拳的孩子，怎能輕易接受一個手持利器的陌生人幫助自己？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"可如果這個孩子即將溺斃？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"穩重的老者","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你仍舊得證明你所說的。阿戈爾的現狀真如你所說那般嗎？海嗣與其根源真的有辦法被戰勝嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"穩重的老者","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"否則伊比利亞不會信任你。我不會信任你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"穩重的老者","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"在我死前，凱爾希，在我死前，你，你們，必須證明給伊比利亞看。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"穩重的老者","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"否則，海水會澆滅文明的火，在其他國家準備好之前，它們會越過伊比利亞，它們會......撕扯這個“世界”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"穩重的老者","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"說不定否定泰拉文明與社會的全部過程，在它們的思維的塵埃裡，都只是物競天擇的一小部分。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"又也許，我們並無本質上的差異。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g16_lighthouse_street"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Dan","speakerId":"npc_2002_Dan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......海邊的小鎮，清閒，但又陰冷。寧靜，但也喧鬧。看似生機勃勃，可又危機四伏，謎團四起......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Dan","speakerId":"npc_2002_Dan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"感覺會是個激發創作慾的好地方！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Dan","speakerId":"npc_2002_Dan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們說呢？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Frost","speakerId":"npc_2003_Frost_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（輕盈的獨奏）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Aya","speakerId":"npc_2001_Aya_1","isRemote":false,"text":"海邊，不安的氣氛。我已經能嗅到那些討人厭的東西了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Aya","speakerId":"npc_2001_Aya_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我還是覺得我們不該這麼草率地出現在海濱。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Alty","speakerId":"npc_2004_Alty","isRemote":false,"text":"沒關係，刺激能產生靈感，你看Dan已經迫不及待了不是嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Frost","speakerId":"npc_2003_Frost_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（低沉的獨奏）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Dan","speakerId":"npc_2002_Dan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"音樂的靈感！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Alty","speakerId":"npc_2004_Alty","isRemote":false,"text":"......對。汲取靈感的機會。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Aya","speakerId":"npc_2001_Aya_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我從沒想過我們會依靠那片變異的海洋汲取靈感。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Dan","speakerId":"npc_2002_Dan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"正因為沒想過，才有取材的價值。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Alty","speakerId":"npc_2004_Alty","isRemote":false,"text":"說得好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Frost","speakerId":"npc_2003_Frost_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（贊同的獨奏）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Aya","speakerId":"npc_2001_Aya_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......那，我們要分頭行動嗎？我可以一個人把行李帶去旅店。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Dan","speakerId":"npc_2002_Dan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好哎！那我先去那邊看看？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Alty","speakerId":"npc_2004_Alty","isRemote":false,"text":"你一個人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Aya","speakerId":"npc_2001_Aya_1","isRemote":false,"text":"謝謝你的擔心，也謝謝你記得我們在這裡是會有“危險”的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Frost","speakerId":"npc_2003_Frost_1","isRemote":false,"text":"旅店，在哪？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Dan","speakerId":"npc_2002_Dan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"說起來，這樣的小鎮竟然還能有旅店？會有人來這種地方嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Aya","speakerId":"npc_2001_Aya_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大家總要想辦法活下去的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Alty","speakerId":"npc_2004_Alty","isRemote":false,"text":"對，活下去才有音樂。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Frost","speakerId":"npc_2003_Frost_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（獨奏）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Aya","speakerId":"npc_2001_Aya_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......海。海啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Aya","speakerId":"npc_2001_Aya_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們回來了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_ibchurch"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不好意思......能讓一讓嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":"avg_npc_450_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，沒事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您今天也在禮拜堂坐了一天嗎？呃......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":"avg_npc_450_1","isRemote":false,"text":"極境。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉......都見過好幾次了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":"avg_npc_450_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒關係，“極境”這個名字在這不常見吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":"avg_npc_450_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不如說，我這樣的帥哥，在伊比利亞本來就不太常見吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......哈......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不過您這樣總是這麼自信的人......倒確實......不多見。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":"avg_npc_450_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":"avg_npc_450_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我也是在這裡待了一段時間之後，才發覺自己以為的那個家鄉，不完全都是那個家鄉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"極境先生，今天也只是在這裡等人嗎？已經過了好幾天了吧......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":"avg_npc_450_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊哈哈，我的工作就是這種性質，沒辦法。而且在這裡，總比在蟲子和源石簇遍地都是的原始森林裡好點。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......您是外面來的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":"avg_npc_450_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，你能感覺到？是因為我沉澱下來的氣質嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"其實......呃......也可以說是？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":"avg_npc_450_1","isRemote":false,"text":"比如？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"服裝......什麼的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":"avg_npc_450_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你很懂行嘛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......很少有人會來格蘭法洛。這裡沒太多人，土生土長的孩子都能認出鎮上的每一張臉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還有......因為離海很近......願意這麼積極地與阿戈爾人對話的黎博利，越來越少了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而且自從審判庭的人頻繁出入之後，就更加......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":"avg_npc_450_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":"avg_npc_450_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道。這種事情我見過不少。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這種事也發生在伊比利亞的其他城市？傳聞中那些歌舞昇平的城市......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":"avg_npc_450_1","isRemote":false,"text":"發生在伊比利亞之外的每一寸土地。其實在我看來，都沒差太多就是啦，家家有本難念的經。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":"avg_npc_450_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不過我見過更難搞的阿戈爾人喔，提起來就讓人頭疼的那種。想把自己的常識全部灌進他們腦子裡的那種。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":"avg_npc_450_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你已經算很好相處的了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":"avg_npc_450_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你幹嘛用一種“你的常識能有用嗎”的表情看著我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒、沒有！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":"avg_npc_450_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別看我現在像個無業遊民一樣每天閒逛打發時間，我也是走過很——遠的路，見過很——多事情的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"原來極境先生還是位探險家啊......那在其他地方，阿戈爾人生活得怎麼樣？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":"avg_npc_450_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......哈哈。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":"avg_npc_450_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還行吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":"avg_npc_450_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......還行。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_ibbar"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_449_1","isRemote":false,"text":"蒂亞戈鎮長......您沒必要每天都來這裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂亞戈","speakerId":"avg_npc_451_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有一些不好的傳聞。我擔心你們......阿瑪雅。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿瑪雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_449_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不好的傳聞......是說那些邪教徒的傳聞嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿瑪雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_449_1","isRemote":false,"text":"審判庭離我們如此之近，我們不僅靠近海洋，也靠近伊比利亞如今的心臟。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿瑪雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_449_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼會發生那些事情呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂亞戈","speakerId":"avg_npc_451_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不確定。離海近的地方，都會有這樣的事情。這不算稀奇。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂亞戈","speakerId":"avg_npc_451_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而且我聽說......有人在海岸上看見了怪物。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿瑪雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_449_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......聽老佩德里說的嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿瑪雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_449_1","isRemote":false,"text":"缺少酒精的時候，他總胡言亂語。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂亞戈","speakerId":"avg_npc_451_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿瑪雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_449_1","isRemote":false,"text":"心善的蒂亞戈，你只是在擔心那個在禮拜堂做工的喬迪，對吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂亞戈","speakerId":"avg_npc_451_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我沒什麼文化......也許阿瑪雅你能幫我，讓我安心些......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂亞戈","speakerId":"avg_npc_451_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那些傳說......會是真的嗎？幽靈船，邪教徒，還有深海裡蟄伏的怪物......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿瑪雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_449_1","isRemote":false,"text":"審判庭已經很久不允許我們出海了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂亞戈","speakerId":"avg_npc_451_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是，我已經記不得是八十四年還是八十五年了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿瑪雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_449_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大靜謐發生在1038年，禁令不過持續了五六十年而已。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿瑪雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_449_1","isRemote":false,"text":"蒂亞戈，你在你自己的記憶裡，被禁足了那麼長時間嗎？可你還沒有那麼大的年紀，你從出生開始就被囚禁在這座小鎮嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂亞戈","speakerId":"avg_npc_451_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果說清貧的生活是一種囚禁，那我確實當了許久的囚徒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂亞戈","speakerId":"avg_npc_451_1","isRemote":false,"text":"馬琳死後，我甚至沒有看過大海。我痛恨它。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿瑪雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_449_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你其實不擔心那些流言蜚語，你擔心的是審判庭。你擔心更多的懲戒軍來到這裡，會把阿戈爾人統統帶走。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂亞戈","speakerId":"avg_npc_451_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿瑪雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_449_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，可憐的蒂亞戈......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿瑪雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_449_1","isRemote":false,"text":"審判庭奪走了那個阿戈爾女人的性命，奪走了你的愛人，你的不滿與憤懣我可以理解，但為了所有人，還是謹言慎行吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂亞戈","speakerId":"avg_npc_451_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......或許你說得對。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂亞戈","speakerId":"avg_npc_451_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......好吧。都聽你的，你懂的比我們都多......你今天在做什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿瑪雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_449_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一如既往，蒂亞戈。在這悠閒到令人害怕的城鎮裡，做好我的本職工作，一介不入流的翻譯家的工作。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿瑪雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_449_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不過信使已經有很多個月沒來過這個小鎮了，積壓的稿子真讓人頭疼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂亞戈","speakerId":"avg_npc_451_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，翻譯！我一輩子都沒走出過這座小鎮，除了伊比利亞語，我根本看不懂別的語言。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿瑪雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_449_1","isRemote":false,"text":"天色也不早了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂亞戈","speakerId":"avg_npc_451_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是，喬迪應該快收工了......希望這兩天，審判庭不會因為流言蜚語來找他的麻煩。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂亞戈","speakerId":"avg_npc_451_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我先走了，阿瑪雅。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿瑪雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_449_1","isRemote":false,"text":"走好，蒂亞戈鎮長。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿瑪雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_449_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......邪教徒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿瑪雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_449_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"narration","text":"名為阿瑪雅的年輕女性思忖片刻，仍舊將思緒放回了面前的紙張上。\n烏薩斯的小說，卡西米爾的傳記，萊塔尼亞的詩歌，薩爾貢的民謠故事......\n此刻，這片大地以書籍的名義堆積在女性的面前，以文字的名號拆解，有序而莊嚴。\n空氣很潮濕，讓她不由輕輕捏了捏頁角。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿瑪雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_449_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......海的觸感。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿瑪雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_449_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“浪花在加速。風在膽怯。珊瑚繪於天際，鋪滿螢光。”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿瑪雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_449_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“我們會憎恨自己沒有翅膀。”"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_ibchurch"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":"avg_npc_450_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的工作做完了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，呃，是的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如您所見，這裡平時根本沒有什麼人，我的工作也只是稍微打掃打掃衛生，這樣而已。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您今天也要等下去？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":"avg_npc_450_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊。其實上周她們就該到了，不過上頭確實叮囑過我，她們都是很奇怪的人，遲到不算什麼就是了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雖然我覺得遲到還是不太好，可現如今還會有人專程約在格蘭法洛見面？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":"avg_npc_450_1","isRemote":false,"text":"很奇怪吧。我也覺得很奇怪，所以當Misery先生提起的時候，我自告奮勇就來了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":"avg_npc_450_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是沒想到這一住就是一個月啊。待命時間真長。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是審判庭......不會允許你們這樣的外來者進入格蘭法洛才對。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":"avg_npc_450_1","isRemote":false,"text":"因為這裡離審判庭的中樞很近？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":"avg_npc_450_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還是因為......這裡靠近大海？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......也許二者皆有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":"avg_npc_450_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......原來如此......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您是怎麼抵達這裡的？我去過的地方不多，但我也知道格蘭法洛只是個被遺棄的角落......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":"avg_npc_450_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你要是想聽，我倒是不介意多個聊天的伴，我無聊死了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果不麻煩您的話，有機會......啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不好意思，已經這個時間了，蒂亞戈叔叔還等著我，我得回去做飯了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":"avg_npc_450_1","isRemote":false,"text":"家人嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊......算是吧。蒂亞戈叔叔把我養大的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":"avg_npc_450_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你看，你沒必要因為自己是個阿戈爾人就這麼低聲下氣，既然還有人願意對你抱有善意，你也該試著積極一些。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......嗯。謝謝，極境先生。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_i26"},{"type":"narration","text":"格蘭法洛。在伊比利亞的古老語言裡，是燈塔的意思。\n燈塔曾經照亮著船舶，燈塔曾經成為海員的歸宿。\n多少靈魂寄宿在礁石之下，直到船舶愛上海洋，相擁，而後滅亡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（阿瑪雅小姐？她去哪裡......唔。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（前面好像很熱鬧，真難得，發生什麼了？）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_i26"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Alty","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你打算去哪？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Dan","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"禮拜堂！人們的雙手不該用來祈禱，他們應該學會敲鑼打鼓！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Aya","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......這個廣場就是小鎮的中心。所有建築都圍繞著這個廣場。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Frost","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"雕塑，燈塔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Frost","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"既是海洋的燈塔，也是這座城鎮的燈塔......雙關。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Dan","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"這個比喻好土！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"路過的鎮民","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"奇怪的人，別和她們走太近......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"看熱鬧的鎮民","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"之前老佩德里不是說......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"路過的鎮民","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"別扯上關係，免得被審判庭帶走。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"路過的鎮民","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"真是，最近怎麼有這麼多外來者，審判庭是不是不管事了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（沒見過的人......她們的打扮......是音樂家嗎？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（呃，她是不是看過來了？）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g18_lighthouse_square"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Aya","speakerId":"npc_2001_Aya_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您、您好......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Aya","speakerId":"npc_2001_Aya_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在海邊看到阿戈爾人應該是一件很正常的事情，可一路走過來，我現在反而覺得你這樣的阿戈爾人稀奇了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Aya","speakerId":"npc_2001_Aya_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你知道......這裡正在發生什麼嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什、什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Aya","speakerId":"npc_2001_Aya_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，你不知道，你也不是海洋的孩子。你是個生在陸地上的阿戈爾人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Aya","speakerId":"npc_2001_Aya_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，我已經一點都不意外了，真的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Alty","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"Aya，這邊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Aya","speakerId":"npc_2001_Aya_1","isRemote":false,"text":"來了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Aya","speakerId":"npc_2001_Aya_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦，對了......你......嗯......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我、我怎麼了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Aya","speakerId":"npc_2001_Aya_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你知道這座雕塑上的是什麼嗎？本地人都知道嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是......一座燈塔。以前這裡似乎圍繞著那座燈塔開展過不少工作，後來許多工人家庭就留在這裡了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Aya","speakerId":"npc_2001_Aya_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你也一樣？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊......是。我家裡至今還有一些當時的物件，圖紙啊，照片啊什麼的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Aya","speakerId":"npc_2001_Aya_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......燈塔。伊比利亞的燈塔，陸上國家的燈塔，挺幽默的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Aya","speakerId":"npc_2001_Aya_1","isRemote":false,"text":"氣味似乎不是來自你的身上，那麼，你們可就要格外小心了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒見過的人......那是樂器嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......難道是極境先生在等的人？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂亞戈","speakerId":"avg_npc_451_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喬迪。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，蒂亞戈叔叔，抱歉，我應該早點去找你——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂亞戈","speakerId":"avg_npc_451_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別和她們扯上關係，看不見她們的尾巴和耳朵，也看不見她們的羽，也許她們都是阿戈爾人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂亞戈","speakerId":"avg_npc_451_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喬迪，好孩子，你知道我不是對阿戈爾人有意見，可別忘了這些天的謠言。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂亞戈","speakerId":"avg_npc_451_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不要和這些外來的阿戈爾人走得太近，如果一個阿戈爾人出現在海邊，而他的身邊沒有審判官或是懲戒軍，那麼他一定有問題。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂亞戈","speakerId":"avg_npc_451_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我願意相信她們是善良的，但是審判庭未必如此，所以......對不起......我不想看見你被帶走，你必須表現得乖巧一些。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我明白，你不用道歉，蒂亞戈叔叔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我都明白。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g17_lighthouse_alley"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"我很意外，您居然答應得如此乾脆。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"聖徒卡門","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"三名深海獵人......鹽風城的事情，我已經知道了。艾麗妮的報告總是十分詳細。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"聖徒卡門","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而且我也相信，若是你有意荼毒伊比利亞，會有更簡單的方法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"聖徒卡門","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"深海獵人......就算她們真如報告裡所說的那麼強壯、迅捷，三名，也依舊在審判庭的可控範疇之內。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"聖徒卡門","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"審判庭保留處死她們的權力。我只是對你所謂的真相感到好奇，因而允許她們行走在伊比利亞的土地上，僅此而已。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"伊比利亞是否正是因為這樣的傲慢才導致現狀惡化？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"聖徒卡門","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"事實上，我們對傲慢一詞無比瞭解。傲慢對人類而言就像影子，依附在行將就木的腳步上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"聖徒卡門","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那兩位與你有緣的審判官已經接到了審判庭的密令，如有必要，他們會出現在我們的面前。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"聖徒卡門","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......似乎還有幾個不明身份的阿戈爾人來到了格蘭法洛。我可沒聽你提起過。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"聖徒卡門","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她們是什麼人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"她們並非阿戈爾人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"聖徒卡門","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"聖徒卡門","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"儘管伊比利亞的史冊極少提及，可在這個國度鼎盛之時，我們甚至敢跨過整片大陸，向玻利瓦爾平原進軍......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"聖徒卡門","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"多少金幣和知識一同流入我們的城市，就像水流從高處跌入山谷。那些榮耀的瀑布發出聲響，甚至能蓋過浪濤。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"聖徒卡門","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......（薩爾貢語）崛起之物，或者是，“巨獸”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"聖徒卡門","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也許我該留意的是她們。她們沒有敵意，卻讓我感到警覺......又也許，她們曾屬於海洋。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"聖徒卡門","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"凱爾希，你才是醫生。也許你能幫審判庭一個忙？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"......您說。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"聖徒卡門","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"審判庭的中樞離如今的海岸線極近。我們做好了隨時迎接毀滅的準備。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"聖徒卡門","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但，我需要你，一個外人，成為我們向前遠眺的眼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"在這件事上我們的利害一致，我沒有拒絕您的理由。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"聖徒卡門","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"收拾好更加漫長的歲月帶給你的神秘感吧，醫生，讓我們來看看那些蟄伏在人民中的惡孽，潛藏何處。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"權當您的誇讚......我榮幸之至。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g26_dusk_wild"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"......歌蕾蒂婭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"短暫的相處讓你變換了措辭。這一點上，你確實與以往大不相同。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"......二隊長，我有問題。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"從那個腐臭的海岸離開以來，我們已經共用了所有的情報。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"還不是全部。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"我們去就足夠了，我不明白，為什麼要帶上......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看看她如今的樣子。這本該是她曾經的模樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我調查了她在羅德島接受治療時的所有記錄......你也沒見過她如此沉默的狀態。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"難道你不想幫她？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"這樣能幫她？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也許可以。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"最終擊垮那些幻象的只有她自己。她是自己的鑰匙，她能突破那些骯髒的實驗結論，她可是勞倫緹娜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......可是在那之前，我們得替她備好溫床。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽靈鯊？","speakerId":"avg_1023_ghost2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"她短暫地清醒過......可我又眼睜睜看著她......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別這麼感性。我們不是她，如果連她自己都不討厭自己的那副模樣，就輪不到我們置喙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"你比我想的還要相信凱爾希醫生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也許吧。她願意孤身留在伊比利亞，為我們創造機會，我很驚訝......也不得不感激。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但願她一切順利。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_ibchurch"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":"avg_npc_450_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......已經這個時間了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":"avg_npc_450_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看來今天也不會來了。我還想著只要在這座小鎮上唯一顯眼的建築裡待著，就遲早會遇到她們呢......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":"avg_npc_450_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不過在駐點的生活也太無聊了，早知道就從羅德島多帶些閒書——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Alty","speakerId":"npc_2004_Alty","isRemote":false,"text":"——拉特蘭禮拜堂！在海邊還保留得如此完整，真不可思議！嗯，可是這裡的風格還真是截然不同啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Alty","speakerId":"npc_2004_Alty","isRemote":false,"text":"畢竟拉特蘭的禮拜堂只要有拉特蘭人在，那可都是能即興演出的，這裡也太死氣沉沉啦......嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":"avg_npc_450_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":"avg_npc_450_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——Alty小姐？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g16_lighthouse_street"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂亞戈","speakerId":"avg_npc_451_1","isRemote":false,"text":"最近別靠近海邊，喬迪。禮拜堂很安全，也很乾淨，你只需要待在那裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂亞戈","speakerId":"avg_npc_451_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你別操心其他的事......今年回來的年輕人並不多，離開這裡的，大都會想辦法去大城市定居......如今我們全靠審判庭的援助才能生活。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂亞戈","speakerId":"avg_npc_451_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你也該考慮我所說的，離開這裡。這裡的人，都來自過去為了維修燈塔而聚集起的工人家庭，時代變化，這裡遲早會被拋棄。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂亞戈","speakerId":"avg_npc_451_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......喬迪？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我在聽，叔叔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是，阿戈爾人又能去哪裡呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂亞戈","speakerId":"avg_npc_451_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿瑪雅說，外面的一些地方，伊比利亞的其他地方，對阿戈爾人沒那麼殘酷。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可我總要找到我自己的家。有些東西，有些聯繫，我沒辦法......那麼簡單地下決定。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......還沒準備好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂亞戈","speakerId":"avg_npc_451_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......好吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂亞戈","speakerId":"avg_npc_451_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對了，阿瑪雅又給了我一本書，她翻譯的書，反正我看不懂，你應該帶去禮拜堂打發時間。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"喬迪平靜地走在街道上。\n他看著眼前老人逐漸佝僂的身形，不由回憶起上一年蒂亞戈的神態。\n衰老總是這麼無言，證明歲月在緩緩流逝。從夢醒到睡眠的每一個瞬間，都像在呼吸中掙扎。\n可喬迪沒有怨言。他習慣於這樣的生活。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......蒂亞戈叔叔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂亞戈","speakerId":"avg_npc_451_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我覺得現在的日子很好。我可以在禮拜堂幫忙，偶爾照料孩子，偶爾替那些做工受傷的人處理傷口。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"最近，我還認識了那個外面來的黎博利，他很與眾不同，他說他叫極境。你不用這麼擔心我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"畢竟審判庭已經很久沒有來過這座城鎮了，我們不用這麼緊張。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂亞戈","speakerId":"avg_npc_451_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那不是禮拜堂，是哨所，工人們還在嘗試維修燈塔的時候，審判庭為了監督我們，在這裡設立了一座哨所。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂亞戈","speakerId":"avg_npc_451_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可現在，新的海岸線已經平靜，伊比利亞之眼的修復工作也擱置了，審判庭當然不會管我們的死活。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂亞戈","speakerId":"avg_npc_451_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當然，平心而論，審判庭也不是一無是處，只有他們能攔住那些......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......那些？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂亞戈","speakerId":"avg_npc_451_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒什麼，孩子，只是工人們口口相傳的一些謠言。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......謠言......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂亞戈","speakerId":"avg_npc_451_1","isRemote":false,"text":"孩子？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_ibindoor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......在......在這嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那到底是什麼......是不是應該先通知蒂亞戈叔叔......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海怪","speakerId":"avg_npc_457_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g16_lighthouse_street"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂亞戈","speakerId":"avg_npc_451_1","isRemote":false,"text":"孩子？你在想什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......不，沒什麼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"蒂亞戈叔叔......海邊，有什麼？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_003_kalts","aliases":["凱爾希"]},{"speakerId":"char_263_skadi","aliases":["斯卡蒂"]}]}
